    "promptUsed": "{\"tags\":[\"rocket launch tower\",\"stainless steel booster\",\"night coastal marsh\",\"aerial drone view\",\"full moon scene\"],\"short_caption\":\"An aerial drone view at night captures a tall steel lattice launch tower holding a stainless steel rocket booster on a flat coastal marsh beside the ocean under a starry sky and full moon.\",\"long_caption\":\"An aerial drone view at night depicts a towering steel lattice rocket launch tower situated on a flat coastal marsh adjacent to the open ocean. Two large mechanical arms attached to the tower securely hold a tall, cylindrical stainless steel rocket booster. Bright white floodlights mounted on the structure illuminate the tower and the booster, contrasted by small red aviation warning lights glowing at high points. Wisps of white vapor vent outward from the base of the rocket into the cool night air. Above, a dark starry sky features a bright glowing full moon that casts a soft silvery light across the scene, creating reflections on the winding tidal channels and the dark sea surface. Along the distant horizon, a faint cluster of city lights glows softly against the darkness. The atmosphere is stark and industrial, captured in a photorealistic cinematic style.\",\"style_and_atmosphere\":\"Photorealistic cinematic still with a dramatic, industrial night atmosphere, defined by high contrast between artificial floodlighting and natural moonlight.\",\"lighting\":\"Bright white floodlights provide primary key illumination directly onto the launch tower and rocket booster. Small red aviation warning lights punctuate the upper structure. Ambient moonlight from a full moon illuminates the surrounding marsh and sea, complemented by distant orange city glow along the horizon.\",\"key_subjects_and_objects\":\"A tall steel lattice launch tower constructed from dark gray painted metal beams stands vertically, featuring maintenance platforms, ladders, and two large mechanical clamp arms extending from its side. A massive, cylindrical stainless steel rocket booster with a reflective metallic sheen is held firmly between the two mechanical arms of the tower. Wisps of white vapor continuously vent from the lower sections of the rocket booster into the surrounding air.\",\"environment_and_layout\":\"The scene is set on a flat, expansive coastal marsh covered in low grasses and interlaced with winding tidal channels of dark water, bordering the open ocean on one side. The launch tower is anchored securely into the solid ground of the marsh platform near the water's edge. A vast, dark starry sky arches overhead, containing a luminous full moon. A distant coastline on the horizon features a faint line of municipal lights.\",\"visible_progression\":\"no clear progression is visible across the set.\",\"text_and_ocr\":{\"verbatim_strings\":[],\"notes\":\"none\"},\"artifacts_and_overlays\":\"none\"}",
